Package: scSTMseq
Title: scSTMseq: Topic Modeling for Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person("Euphy", "Wu", email="euphy.w@gmail.com", role=c("aut","ctb", "cre")),
    person("Naim", "Rashid", role="ctb"),
    person("Didong", "Li", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: scSTMseq provides a topic modeling framework for inferring latent 
    cell groups from paired or time-series single-cell sequencing data. Built on 
    structured topic modeling (STM), it allows incorporation of cell-level covariates 
    while further accounting for sample-level random variation. The method also 
    addresses clustering uncertainty by sampling from the inferred posterior distributions.
